# L §7.3 lists what takes `to u` (transcendentals, distribution functions and samples, crps of a normal,
# periodic and factor); `to` on an exact plain value is given no meaning, refused at load where the types show it
# (L §8.4 What isn't defined is refused: LOAD-UNIT).
=== m.tally
model t
  tally 2
  on 2026-12-31
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source s "s"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01

input x: num
def y: num = x to 0.01 at reader
=== expect
refused: LOAD-UNIT ...
